# LLMEvals — G-Eval v1/v2 judge calibration kit (2026-11-05)

Contents:
- `CODEX_PROMPT.md`: paste its contents into Codex from the root of your EXISTING LLMEvals project.
- `rubrics/v1_20261103.json`: unchanged 2026-11-03 reference metric set.
- `rubrics/v2_review_20261105.json`: proposed 2026-11-05 review draft, NOT an approved/frozen standard.
- `calibration/benchmark_examples_7.jsonl`: seven real October discussion examples; reference answers are provisional and must be joined to current audited local records and evidence.

